```

### List Block Items

```java
PagedIterable<TextBlocklistItem> items = 
    blocklistClient.listTextBlocklistItems("my-blocklist");

for (TextBlocklistItem item : items) {
    System.out.printf("ID: %s, Text: %s%n",
